msgstr ""

msgid "SBOMs can be fed into vulnerability scanners such as https://github.com/anchore/grype[Grype] to identify known vulnerabilities in application dependencies. This section demonstrates how to use Quarkus-generated SBOMs with Grype."
msgstr ""

